message: "If you use this code or the derived tables, please cite the paper and this repository."
type: software
title: "health-misinfo-context: code and derived tables for a comparison of CoAID and FakeHealth"
abstract: "Code, saved splits, model locks, classical model bundles, aggregate tables, bootstrap draws and item-level predictions behind a comparison of Fake–Real differences in observed social-media engagement and text detectability across CoAID, FakeHealth, the COVID-19 Rumor Dataset and FakeNewsNet. Source datasets are not redistributed."
